# robinhood-toolkit · Uniswap addresses for Robinhood Chain (dex module)
# Author: nirholas · https://github.com/nirholas/robinhood-toolkit
# License: MIT (c) 2026 nirholas
#
# Copy to dex/.env (git-ignored) and run:  node --env-file=dex/.env dex/check.mjs
#
# Every value below was resolved from Uniswap's official deployment docs and
# then proved on-chain by dex/check.mjs (see dex/DEPLOYMENTS.md for the audit
# trail). Do NOT paste an address here from a blog post, a chat message, or a
# generated snippet. Re-run dex/check.mjs after any change.
#
# MAINNET — chain 4663. Source: Uniswap docs, v3 + v4 Robinhood Chain pages.

# Required to quote and execute a v3 swap:
UNI_V3_FACTORY=0x1f7d7550b1b028f7571e69a784071f0205fd2efa
UNI_SWAP_ROUTER_02=0xcaf681a66d020601342297493863e78c959e5cb2
UNI_QUOTER_V2=0x33e885ed0ec9bf04ecfb19341582aadcb4c8a9e7

# Optional — v2 (Uniswap publishes no v2 deployment for chain 4663; leave unset):
# UNI_V2_FACTORY=

# Optional — Universal Router / Permit2 (needed for v4 and UniswapX routes):
UNI_UNIVERSAL_ROUTER=0x8876789976decbfcbbbe364623c63652db8c0904
UNI_PERMIT2=0x000000000022D473030F116dDEE9F6B43aC78BA3

# Optional — v4 PoolManager (different approval + calldata model; see gotchas):
UNI_V4_POOL_MANAGER=0x8366a39cc670b4001a1121b8f6a443a643e40951

# check.mjs / fork rehearsal knobs:
CHAIN_ID=4663
RPC_URL=https://rpc.mainnet.chain.robinhood.com

# TESTNET — chain 46630. Uniswap publishes NO deployment for the Robinhood
# testnet as of 2026-07-21. Do not invent one; resolveUniswap(46630) will throw.

# Swap signer (fork rehearsal only — never commit a real key):
# PRIVATE_KEY=0x...
